"This zone has no transferred records yet. Wait for the transfer to complete "
"before converting it to a primary zone."
msgstr ""
"Ta cona še nima prenesenih zapisov. Pred pretvorbo v primarno cono "
"počakajte, da se prenos dokonča."

#: lib/Module/SecondaryZoneImport/Controller/SecondaryZoneImportController.php:184
