#: lib/Application/Service/Zone/ZoneOwnershipMessages.php:36
msgid ""
"Cannot remove the last user owner: zone ownership mode is users_only and "
"requires at least one user owner. Add another user owner first."
msgstr ""
"Ni mogoče odstraniti zadnjega lastnika uporabnika: način lastništva cone je "
"users_only in zahteva vsaj enega lastnika uporabnika. Najprej dodajte "
"drugega lastnika uporabnika."

#: lib/Application/Service/Zone/ZoneOwnershipMessages.php:37
msgid ""
"Cannot remove user owner: zone ownership mode is groups_only and the zone "
