#: templates/default/add_supermaster.html:64
msgid ""
"A supermaster is a PowerDNS authoritative server that automatically pushes "
"new zones to its slaves."
msgstr ""
"Supermaster je avtoritativni strežnik PowerDNS, ki samodejno potiska nove "
"cone svojim podrejenim strežnikom."

#: templates/default/add_supermaster.html:67
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "Kako deluje"

#: templates/default/add_supermaster.html:68
msgid ""
"When a slave receives a notification from a supermaster, it adds the domain "
"and sets the supermaster's IP address as the master address."
msgstr ""
"Ko podrejeni strežnik prejme obvestilo od supermasterja, doda domeno in "
"nastavi naslov IP supermasterja kot naslov glavnega strežnika."

#: templates/default/add_supermaster.html:71
msgid "Important Notes"
msgstr "Pomembne opombe"

#: templates/default/add_supermaster.html:73
msgid ""
"The hostname must match exactly what appears in the NS record of the zone."
msgstr ""
"Ime gostitelja se mora natančno ujemati s tistim, kar je navedeno v zapisu "
"NS te cone."

#: templates/default/add_supermaster.html:74
msgid ""
"Ensure your firewall allows DNS notifications between masters and slaves."
msgstr ""
"Poskrbite, da vaš požarni zid omogoča obvestila DNS med glavnimi in "
"podrejenimi strežniki."

