#: templates/default/list_views.html:8
msgid "View Behavior:"
msgstr "Obnašanje pogleda:"

#: templates/default/list_views.html:9
msgid ""
"Views serve different zone variants to different clients based on the "
"network that queried the resolver. Each variant is named zone..variant (for "
"example, example.com..trusted) and must exist as a separate zone in PowerDNS "
"before it can be assigned here. Variants share a name but resolve "
"differently per view, so the same hostname can answer with different IPs "
"depending on the client's network."
msgstr ""
"Pogledi strežejo različne variante con različnim odjemalcem glede na "
"omrežje, iz katerega je bila poslana poizvedba razreševalniku. Vsaka "
"varianta se imenuje zone..variant (na primer example.com..trusted) in mora "
"obstajati kot ločena cona v PowerDNS, preden jo je mogoče dodeliti tukaj. "
"Variante si delijo ime, vendar se razrešujejo različno glede na pogled, tako "
"da lahko isto ime gostitelja odgovori z različnimi IP-ji, odvisno od omrežja "
"odjemalca."

#: templates/default/list_views.html:15
msgid "No views configured yet. Add a zone variant below."
msgstr "Pogledi še niso nastavljeni. Spodaj dodajte varianto cone."

#: templates/default/list_views.html:34
